A oneOf named U with const-discriminated variants: the variant types are
named UX and UY once, with constructors NewUX and NewUY (F8, F9;
TestRunGeneratesRecasedUnion). The runtime needs ProtocolMethodCancelRequest,
so the meta declares $/cancel_request and the schema its smallest definition.

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"},
  "U": {"oneOf": [
    {"type": "object", "properties": {"type": {"const": "x", "type": "string"}, "n": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["type", "n"]},
    {"type": "object", "properties": {"type": {"const": "y", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["type"]}
  ]}
}}
-- want.api --
